# Description of this project and its data for research data management.
# Every field is optional. pyglotaran reads none of them and copies this file into every export.
title: Getting started with pyglotaran
description: >
  Global analysis of a simulated sequential decay of three compartments, used in the getting
  started guide of pyglotaran.
data_description: >
  Simulated data from glotaran.testing.simulated_data.sequential_spectral_decay: 2100 time
  points from -1 to 19.99, 72 spectral points from 600 to 699.4, a Gaussian instrument
  response function and noise with a standard deviation of 0.01.
creators:
  - name: The pyglotaran developers
    orcid:
    affiliation:
keywords: [global analysis, simulated data]
license:
related_identifiers:
